    "What elixirs give (owner, from the live game, 2026-10-15). Restart the server after editing.",
    "tiers: flat + percent of your own stat for attack, defence, armour, maxHealth, maxEnergy (percent of your attack, defence...), healthRegen and energyRegen (flat + percent of max health/energy, every regen tick); haste and runSpeed are percents; xp and abilityGain multiply (4 = four times).",
    "haste replaces haste from gear (it doesn't stack with it), and never takes a weapon faster than minAttackDelay milliseconds a swing.",
    "normal: the flat parts are the game data's; the percents are a guess (half of super) until checked on live.",
    "elixirs: the elixir status effects (ids from the game data), what each gives, and which tier each of its levels is. Elixirs don't stack: per stat the strongest active one counts.",
    "heroic (owner, from live): attack and defence 100 + 30%, regen 10 + 3% of max, haste 60%, run speed 80%, xp and ability gains x5. Armour (100 + 30%) and max health/energy (200 + 30%) follow the same pattern but aren't confirmed yet.",
    "durationSeconds: how long every elixir lasts (owner: 30 minutes; the game data says 15). keepOnDeath: elixirs stay on when you die."
